# Deflecting Palm (CR 616.1, 615.8): Bot1 has Healing Salve's shield of 3. Bot2's Shock (2) leaves 1. Bot2's Lightning Bolt (3)
# is then chosen as the Palm's source; Bot1, the damaged player, applies the shield first: it prevents 1, and the Palm
# prevents the other 2 and deals that much (2, not the Bolt's 3) to Bot2: Bot1 20 - 0, Bot2 20 - 2 = 18.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Healing Salve
Deflecting Palm
Island x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Shock
Lightning Bolt
Island x25

